    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71895" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀᾰρ-ιστύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ύος</span>,
			ἡ, 
			Ep.
		,=<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀαρισμός,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>familiar converse, fond
				discourse,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.216
			</span></i> ; title of <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				27
			</span></i> : generally, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ γὰρ πολέμου
			ὀ.</span> such is war's <i>intercourse,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				17.228
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as concrete,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμάχων ὀ.</span>
			<i>the company</i> of out-fighters, <i><span class="en">
				13.291
			</span></i>.</div>
